         "text": "The possible confounding variables age and total MMSE [18] score were adjusted prior to the analysis by fitting linear regression. We applied multivariate linear regression with LASSO regularization using the lars R package for model selection [19, 20], and the model coefficients were corrected for multiple comparison [21].",
